  "description": "Operating Area: Hamilton Island, Whitsundays, and Airlie Beach, Australia\n\nM/Y ALANI, an 82ft luxurious Sunseeker is the perfect Motor Yacht to charter you around the Whitsunday Islands & Great Barrier Reef year-round.\nWe are exclusively based on Hamilton Island, M/Y ALANI experiences one the 7 wonders of the world year after year, tailoring each charter to suit your ultimate luxury holiday.\nIf you are looking to relax on anchor, find your own slice of paradise on Whitehaven Beach or a fun day out with all the water toys, ALANI is the Motor Yacht for you.",
