      "avatar": "/media/media::image::a::vessel::d5cc7818-fe8c-11ed-889f-43d4bb723744::assets::22f64550-5522-11f1-84bc-a1bdb0e5eab5/{imageVariant}",
      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Hailing from the shorelines of Jervis Bay NSW, Captain George brings a wealth of experience and passion for sailing in the Whitsunday region. For the past four years, he has been dedicated to providing extraordinary voyages for guests departing from Hamilton Island.\n\n"
