      "role": "Captain",
      "bio": "Our welcoming and gregarious deckhand, Harmon, brings a wealth of experience and dedication to every aspect of sea-fairing aboard M/Y ALANI. His warm demeanour and attention to detail make him an invaluable member of our ALANI crew, dedicated to creating an exceptional and personalised maritime experience for every guest.\n"
